让我重新审视风险描述："The regex replacement to derive the English file path may fail for files with unexpected naming patterns, leading to a RuntimeException."

这里的"fail"可能指：
1. 正则替换逻辑本身出错（如 `PatternSyntaxException`）→ 不会，正则硬编码且语法正确
